  { title: "One tap when it's low", desc: "Spot something running low? Mark it to restock. Mark it stocked again once it's home." },
  { title: "Shop it store by store", desc: "Say where you buy each thing — Costco, Target, Amazon — and the restock list sorts itself into one list per store, right alongside your groceries." },
] %>

<%= render "static_pages/cta_band",
